---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
import Section from "../layouts/Section.astro"
import Headline from "../components/headline.astro";
---
<Layout title="Privacy Policy">
    <Section></Section>
    <Section>
        <Headline title="Privacy Policy" description="Your privacy matters to us. Let's keep it safe together.">
            <div class="text-lg text-[#222222]">
                <p><b>Effective Date:</b> July 24, 2026</p>
                <br>
                <p>At Equip The Youth (also known as equiptheyouth), we are committed to protecting the privacy of our supporters, donors, and the communities we serve. This Privacy Policy explains how information is handled when you interact with our website, donate shoes or items, or support our mission.</p>
                <br>
                <h3 class="text-2xl">1. Information Processed by Third-Party Services</h3>
                <br>
                <p>We do not directly collect, store, or process financial information.</p>
                <br>
                <ul class="list-disc pl-5">
                    <li>Online Donations: All online monetary donations are securely processed on our behalf by Stripe. When you make a donation, Stripe collects your name, email address, payment details, and IP address to process the transaction and prevent fraud. You can read how they handle your data in the <a target="_blank" href="https://stripe.com/privacy" class="simple-underline">Stripe Privacy Policy</a>.</li>
                    <br>
                    <li>Website Cookies: Our website may use basic cookies deployed by our website host or Stripe to ensure our donation tools function securely and properly.</li>
                </ul>
                <br>
                <h3 class="text-2xl">2. Information We Collect Directly</h3>
                <br>
                <p>We only collect personal information that you voluntarily provide to us. This includes:</p>
                <br>
                <ul class="list-disc pl-5">
                    <li>Contact Information: Your name, phone number, or email address if you contact us directly to coordinate a shoe drive or item donation.</li>
                    <br>
                    <li>Distribution Records: If you apply for or receive items from us, we may keep a basic internal record of names or clothing/shoe sizes strictly to manage our distribution fairly and accurately.</li>
                </ul>
                <br>
                <h3 class="text-2xl">3. How We Use and Share Information</h3>
                <br>
                <p>We use your information strictly to operate Equip The Youth.</p>
                <br>
                <ul class="list-disc pl-5">
                    <li>We use the email addresses collected during your Stripe donation to automatically send you HTML transaction receipts, donation confirmation messages, and operational updates regarding upcoming shoe drives, item collections, and community distributions.</li>
                    <br>
                    <li>We never sell, rent, or trade your personal information with outside marketers or third parties.</li>
                    <br>
                    <li>We only use your contact details to communicate with you about your specific donation or delivery.</li>
                </ul>
                <br>
                <h3 class="text-2xl">4. Do Not Track Disclosure</h3>
                <br>
                <p>Our website does not track users over time or across third-party websites, and we do not alter our behavior or respond to web browser Do Not Track (DNT) signals.</p>
                <br>
                <h3 class="text-2xl">5. Data Security</h3>
                <br>
                <p>We take reasonable steps to protect any basic contact or distribution records we keep from unauthorized access or disclosure.</p>
                <br>
                <h3 class="text-2xl">6. Changes to This Policy</h3>
                <br>
                <p>We may update this policy occasionally to reflect changes in our tools or operations. Any updates will be posted directly on this page with a revised effective date.</p>
                <br>
                <h3 class="text-2xl">7. Contact Us</h3>
                <br>
                <p>If you have any questions about this Privacy Policy, please contact us at: <a href="mailto:info@equiptheyouth.org"  target="_blank" class="simple-underline">info@equiptheyouth.org</a></p>
            </div>
        </Headline>
    </Section>
</Layout>